<title>JAPAN: Oriental Land delays plan to develop park area.</title>
<headline>Oriental Land delays plan to develop park area.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Disneyland operator Oriental Land Co Ltd said on Tuesday that a plan to develop an area around the theme park would be delayed by a year.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it was reviewing certain aspects of the plan because of a slower than expected recovery in the nation's economy. The company said it now expects to complete the property development project by September 1999 instead of September 1998 and to have a grand opening in October 1999.</p>
</text>
